UID:94485-1788692400-1788696000@bangaloreinternationalcentre.org
SUMMARY:Let’s Fall in Love with Reading!
DESCRIPTION:At home\, in the library\, under a tree\, curled up on a rainy afternoon or perched on a windowsill… there are as many ways to read as there are readers! This International Literacy Day\, Pratham Books’ One Day\, One Story (ODOS) celebrates the simple joy of coming together around a story. Author Rohini Nilekani brings her book I Love to Read to life in a special reading session\, with storyteller Priya Muthukumar bringing fun activities inspired by the story. \nThis session is part of a two-part event on enabling children to read. The second session\, In the Language We Think\, Dream and Belong\, is a panel discussion for adults\, on the making of children’s books. \nAround the World in 50 Sundays is a journey that begins\, not with a ticket\, but with opening a book. In a city like Bangalore where families are always in motion\, the BIC Library hopes to offer stillness and a quiet\, welcoming space for both parents and children where reading becomes a shared experience. Every Sunday\, we open our doors to invite you into a library that listens; building a rhythm of return\, a habit of joy and a new community bound not just by books\, but by the weekly ritual of reading together.\n\nWe welcome your ideas and input. If you have suggestions for children’s events or activities that align with this vision\, we’d love to hear from you. Please reach out to us at library@bangaloreinternationalcentre.org \nIn collaboration with: \n   \nSupported by:\n \nVenue: Library\n\n\n\nStories and Activities for Little Readers\nFor Ages 4-10\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXqqXX4sksAZ5uj8zhGAD8MJiTeXy_bRu88Lta5B-m4DiYyw/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Facilitators*: Rohini Nilekani\, Priya Muthukumar\n*Event Categories*: Around the World in 50 Sundays
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/lets-fall-in-love-with-reading/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Around the World in 50 Sundays
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Thumbnail_LFILWR.jpg
END:VEVENT
